    "updated_at": "2018-02-28T19:52:27Z",
    "body": "Whoa totally forgot about `MathMLElement`. FWIW @annevk  @rniwa I know historically things have been simple(r) placing on `HTMLElement` until realizing `SVGElement` is not only necessary but a tad more difficult when related to `CE` Shadow Root implementation. Even within polyfill attempts usually work is duplicated from `HTMLElement` to `SVGElement`. I'd lay a cowpath @ `Element`.\r\n\r\nMy 2 Satoshi. 😎 ",
